                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "man this game is something else. first off, the atmosphere? absolutely killer. you really feel like you're *there*. the devs nailed the vibe, big time. but holy cow, the bugs. they're everywhere. seriously, sometimes it feels like i'm fighting the game more than the actual enemies. it's such a shame cause there's so much potential here, you know? like, you see glimpses of a truly amazing experience, but then a random glitch just pulls you right out of it. it's super frustrating. i guess if they fix all the technical issues, it could be a masterpiece. right now though, it's just a decent game with a lot of annoyances. worth a look if you can tolerate some jank, but maybe wait for a sale or some big patches first. the ideas are great, just needs polish.",
